  # ======================================================================
  # TAB 5 - STATE DRILL-DOWN (Section A Boxes 1-6 for any State, no access limits)
  # ======================================================================
  - name: drill_header
    type: text
    body_text: '<b>State drill-down</b> &mdash; pick any State/UT in the <b>Drill-down State</b> filter (or click a State on any map). Everything on this tab is for that State only: its full record, Box 3 activity trend, Box 4 group-wise and Box 5 designation-wise data, districts, monthly SMT targets and its assessments.'
